[style name="VisualNovelStyle"]
[signal arg="date_start"]
[background arg="res://Assets/CGs/BG_Ending.png" fade="1.5" wait="true"]
audio Musicly "res://Assets/Music/M_Date_ada.ogg" [fade="2.0" volume="-40.0" bus="Music" sync="Musicly"]
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]You and Ada head out to the hottest club in town! #id:3d
audio Musicly "res://Assets/Music/M_Date_ada.ogg" [fade="2.0" volume="-25.0" bus="Music" sync="Musicly"]
[background scene="res://Scenes & Scripts/CG Scenes/ada_date_cg.tscn" fade="1.5" wait="true"]
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]They're fun and prettier than in their photos. Not a single lie about them being the life of the party was told. #id:3e
Ada: [lspeed = 0.05]Wooo! #id:3f
Ada: [lspeed = 0.05]I love this song! #id:40
Ada: [lspeed = 0.05]Let's dance until we drop! #id:41
Ada: [lspeed = 0.05]You better keep up okay? I want to party all night! #id:42
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]The energy they carry is electric. #id:43
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]While the sparkle of their dress and the body glitter isn’t the only thing that keeps your eyes on them all night, they certainly do help. #id:44
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]They clearly feel the spark since they dance close to you all night. #id:45
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]You both dance, you twirl them, their dress catching the light. #id:46
Ada: [lspeed = 0.05]Two cosmos please! #id:47
Ada: [lspeed = 0.05]You’ll looove the Cosmos here, they’re so good! #id:48
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]She handed you the drink once they arrived, clinking their glass against yours. #id:49
audio "res://Assets/SFX/SFX_GlassClink.wav" [bus="Audio"]
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]You pretend to drink as much as they do, watching them down pretty sunset colored drinks all night, waiting patiently until they reach their limit. #id:4a
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]Once they’re ready to go home, probably a little more drunk than they usually let themselves get, you are quick to offer a ride. They giggle roughly. #id:4b
Ada: [lspeed = 0.05]You are sooo sweet… #id:4c
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]And you simply reply that you were more than happy to take care of them. #id:4d
audio Musicly - [fade="1.5" volume="-5.0" bus="Music"]
[background arg="res://Assets/CGs/BG_Ending.png" fade="1.5" wait="true"]
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]They accept and you get them to your car with ease… The ride back is quiet, with Ada falling asleep in your seat. #id:4e
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]You carry them inside, under the cover of darkness. #id:4f
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]You were hungry. #id:50
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]You pull out soy sauce, vinegar, onion, garlic, ginger, oyster sauce, bay leaves and various seasonings. Everything you needed except the main ingredient… #id:51
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]You glance over at the octopus then at the clock. The marinade for this dish took a while so you should do it now. #id:52
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]Your knife cuts into flesh with no struggle, thanks to the alcohol. #id:53
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]You let the meat sit while you get everything else ready so the flavor really soaks into the flesh. You moved around the kitchen, chopping, washing rice. #id:54
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]When it was time, you threw your prepared ingredients into a frying pan, waiting for the aromatics to start filling the kitchen. #id:55
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]You add the octopus ink, letting it simmer and blanching the octopus so you could add it once the sauce was reduced Perfect. #id:56
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]Poor Ada, bright and soft Ada. #id:57
Narrator: [lspeed = 0.05]The Octopus Aquakin who shone like a bright flame, smothered too soon… But at least you got a delicious dinner out of them, right? #id:58
audio "res://Assets/SFX/SFX_Cooking_Ada.wav" [bus="Audio"]
[wait time="25.0"]
[background arg="res://Assets/CGs/Ending Food CG_Ada.jpg" fade="3.5" wait="true"]
set {is_fdate_success} = true
set {is_date_success} = true
[signal arg="scene_end"]
[end_timeline]